  "content": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Service\",\n  \"name\": \"MOMUTO Custom Jersey Design\",\n  \"description\": \"Send us your concept — an AI render, a sketch, or a brief — and a designer turns it into a production-ready custom soccer uniform. First mockup in 24-48h, revisions until it’s right. $15 to start, credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys — free for a team order.\",\n  \"brand\": { \"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"MOMUTO\" },\n  \"offers\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n    \"price\": \"15.00\",\n    \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\",\n    \"description\": \"Design fee to start — credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys\",\n    \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n    \"priceValidUntil\": \"2026-12-31\"\n  },\n  \"provider\": { \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"MOMUTO\", \"url\": \"https://us.momuto.com\" }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why is there a $15 fee to start?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A designer gives your concept real hours — research, illustration, vectorization, and revisions until it’s right. The $15 keeps the studio focused on teams building something real, and it’s credited in full to your order at 5 or more jerseys — free for a team order.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"When is the $15 credited back?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"When your order reaches 5 or more jerseys, it’s credited to your order total at checkout.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What if my order doesn’t reach 5 jerseys?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The $15 covers a designer’s time on your first concept and mockup. If your order stays under 5 jerseys, that fee is simply what pays for the design work you already received — no additional charge, and nothing else to settle.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What’s included?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A designer on your concept, first mockup in 24–48h, revisions until it’s right, illustration and vectorization work (AI concepts, sketches, reference jerseys, custom graphics), and production-ready files for dye-sublimation printing.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I submit an AI-generated concept (ChatGPT, Midjourney)?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes — that’s exactly what this is built for. Upload your AI render and our designer will adapt it into a production-ready uniform while preserving your vision. This includes vectorizing custom shapes, replicating gradients and textures, and adjusting for real fabric constraints.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What if I just have a brief and no concept?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"That’s fine. Describe your colors, style direction, and any references (existing jerseys, palettes, mood). The more detail the better, but our designers work from briefs every day. You’ll get a mockup in 24–48h regardless.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Prefer to design it yourself? What are the free options?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Two free routes: the 3D designer lets you design in real time with 30+ templates and instant preview. The Ready to Play collection has professional pre-designed jerseys at 10% off custom pricing, with a personalized 24h preview.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is there a minimum order?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No. You can order from a single jersey upward. Pricing starts at $45.90 for one jersey, down to $25.90 per jersey at 10+ units. The $15 is credited to your order at 5+ jerseys.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long until I receive the uniforms?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"25–30 days from order confirmation: 7–12 days production + 10–15 days shipping.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css\" />\n<!-- inject:design-request.css -->\n<style>\n/* ── PAID CONFIRMATION BANNER ── */\n.paid-banner {\n  display: none;\n  background: #14532d;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #166534;\n  padding: 18px 40px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.paid-banner-inner {\n  max-width: 800px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n.paid-banner-icon { color: #4ade80; font-size: 1.1rem; }\n.paid-banner p {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: #bbf7d0;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n.paid-banner p strong { color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }\n\n/* ── PAYMENT GATE SECTION ── */\n.gate-section {\n  padding: 6rem 20px;\n  background: #0a0a0a;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n}\n.gate-container {\n  max-width: 640px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.gate-eyebrow {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #c8352e;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.gate-box {\n  background: #111;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  border-top: 3px solid #c8352e;\n  padding: 48px;\n}\n.gate-box h2 {\n  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: #f5f5f5;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n.gate-price {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: #a1a1aa;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n}\n.gate-price strong { color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: 600; }\n.gate-features {\n  list-style: none;\n  margin: 0 0 36px 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  padding-top: 28px;\n}\n.gate-features li {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: #a1a1aa;\n  padding: 9px 0;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\n}\n.gate-features li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n.gate-features li i { color: #4ade80; font-size: 0.75rem; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.gate-features li strong { color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: 600; }\n.gate-email-row {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.gate-email-input {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 16px 18px;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n  border-right: none;\n  color: #f5f5f5;\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  outline: none;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s;\n}\n.gate-email-input::placeholder {\n  color: #71717a;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.gate-email-input:focus { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }\n.gate-pay-btn {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #c8352e;\n  color: #fff;\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  padding: 16px 28px;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  border: 1px solid #c8352e;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.gate-pay-btn:hover { background: #e04038; }\n.gate-pay-btn.is-disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }\n.gate-refund-guarantee {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #d4d4d8;\n  margin: 16px 0 8px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.gate-refund-guarantee strong { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }\n.gate-refund-note {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: #71717a;\n  margin-bottom: 32px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.gate-divider {\n  border: none;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  margin: 32px 0;\n}\n.gate-alt {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: #71717a;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.gate-alt a {\n  color: #a1a1aa;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  text-underline-offset: 3px;\n  text-decoration-color: #c8352e;\n}\n.gate-alt a:hover { color: #f5f5f5; }\n\n/* ── TRANSFORMATION SECTION ── */\n.transform-section {\n  padding: 6rem 20px;\n  background: #0d0d0d;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n}\n.transform-header {\n  max-width: 700px;\n  margin: 0 auto 4rem;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n.transform-eyebrow {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #c8352e;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n.transform-title {\n  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);\n  font-weight: 400;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: #f5f5f5;\n  line-height: 1;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n.transform-sub {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: #71717a;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n.transform-grid {\n  max-width: 1100px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 2px;\n}\n.transform-item {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 40px 1fr;\n  background: #111;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n}\n.transform-side {\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.transform-side img {\n  width: 100%;\n  display: block;\n  aspect-ratio: 16/10;\n  object-fit: contain;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: #0d0d0f;\n  filter: brightness(0.97);\n  transition: filter 0.35s, transform 0.5s;\n}\n.transform-item:hover .transform-side img { filter: brightness(1.03); transform: scale(1.015); }\n.transform-side-label {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 14px;\n  left: 14px;\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.55rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  color: #fff;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.75);\n  padding: 5px 10px;\n}\n.transform-side-label.label-after {\n  background: #c8352e;\n}\n.transform-arrow-col {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: #0d0d0d;\n  color: #c8352e;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n.transform-meta {\n  padding: 20px 28px;\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n  grid-column: 1 / -1;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n.transform-input-type {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  color: #71717a;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n.transform-desc {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  color: #a1a1aa;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n}\n.transform-desc strong { color: #f5f5f5; font-weight: 600; }\n.transform-time {\n  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  color: #f5f5f5;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  text-align: right;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.transform-time-label {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.55rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  color: #71717a;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n.transform-placeholder {\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16/10;\n  background: #1a1a1a;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\n}\n.transform-placeholder span {\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.62rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  color: #3f3f46;\n}\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .transform-side img { aspect-ratio: auto; padding: 6px; }\n  .transform-item {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .transform-arrow-col {\n    height: 32px;\n    width: 100%;\n    transform: none;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n  .transform-arrow-col i { transform: rotate(90deg); }\n  .transform-meta {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .transform-time, .transform-time-label { text-align: left; }\n}\n\n/* ── PATH CARD — studio variant ── */\n.path-card-studio {\n  border-color: #c8352e !important;\n  background: rgba(200,53,46,0.04) !important;\n}\n.gate-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #c8352e;\n  color: #fff;\n  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 0.58rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .gate-box { padding: 28px 20px; }\n  .gate-email-row { flex-direction: column; }\n  .gate-email-input { border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-bottom: none; }\n  .gate-pay-btn { width: 100%; text-align: center; }\n}\n</style>\n\n<!-- ── PAID BANNER (shown only after Stripe redirect) ── -->\n<div class=\"paid-banner\" id=\"paidBanner\">\n  <div class=\"paid-banner-inner\">\n    <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle paid-banner-icon\"></i>\n    <p><strong>You&rsquo;re in &mdash; your concept is in the queue.</strong> Tell us about your team and upload your reference below; your first mockup lands in 24&ndash;48h.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ── HERO ── -->\n<header class=\"hero full-bleed\">\n<div class=\"hero-content\">\n<h1>Custom Soccer Uniforms <span class=\"highlight\">No One Else Can Wear</span></h1>\n<h3>Send us your concept &mdash; an AI idea, a sketch, your colors &mdash; and a designer turns it into a production-ready uniform. Or design it yourself, free.</h3>\n<p class=\"hero-intro\">MOMUTO gives teams three routes: <strong>Ready to Play</strong> pre-designed jerseys at 10% off, a <strong>real-time 3D designer</strong> to build it yourself, or <strong>Custom Design</strong> &mdash; send your concept and a designer turns it into a wearable, production-ready uniform. First mockup in 24&ndash;48h, revisions until it’s right. $15 to start, credited in full to orders of 5+ jerseys &mdash; free for a team order.</p>\n</div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- ── SOCIAL PROOF ── -->\n<section class=\"social-proof-strip\">\n<div class=\"proof-container\">\n<div class=\"proof-stats\">\n<div class=\"proof-stat\"><span class=\"stat-number\">250+</span><div class=\"stat-label\">Teams Satisfied</div></div>\n<div class=\"proof-stat\"><span class=\"stat-number\">10+</span><div class=\"stat-label\">Countries</div></div>\n<div class=\"proof-stat\"><span class=\"stat-number\">98%</span><div class=\"stat-label\">Satisfaction</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"proof-teams\"><span class=\"proof-team\">Texas &bull; Rec League</span> <span class=\"proof-team\">Ohio &bull; Adult League</span> <span class=\"proof-team\">Florida &bull; Travel Club</span> <span class=\"proof-team\">California &bull; Collegiate Club</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── THREE PATHS ── -->\n<section class=\"path-section\">\n<div class=\"path-container\">\n<div class=\"path-header\">\n<h2>Choose Your Route</h2>\n<p>Design it yourself in seconds &mdash; free. Or send us your concept and a designer builds it for you.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"path-options\">\n\n<div class=\"path-card\" style=\"border-color: var(--accent-red);\">\n<div class=\"path-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-tshirt\"></i></div>\n<h3>Ready to Play</h3>\n<div class=\"path-for\">Free &middot; Proven designs &middot; 10% off &middot; Preview in 24h</div>\n<p class=\"path-description\">Professional designs worn by real teams. Pick one, choose your colors, upload your badge &mdash; done. Same fabric and printing as custom. From &#36;25.90/jersey at 10+ &mdash; a rotating seasonal selection is 10% off.</p>\n<a href=\"/pages/ready-to-play\" class=\"path-cta path-cta-primary\">Browse Ready to Play</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"path-card\">\n<div class=\"path-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-cube\"></i></div>\n<h3>3D Designer</h3>\n<div class=\"path-for\">Free &middot; Design it yourself &middot; Instant preview</div>\n<p class=\"path-description\">Build your uniform online in real time &mdash; 30+ templates, full color control, badge placement, instant 3D preview. Order directly when you&rsquo;re happy.</p>\n<a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&amp;configId=ypi9qc1z&amp;suitName=mamuto3suit1&amp;lang=en&amp;langguage=en\" class=\"path-cta\">Open 3D Designer</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"path-card path-card-studio\">\n<div class=\"gate-badge\">Custom Design</div>\n<div class=\"path-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-pencil-ruler\"></i></div>\n<h3>Concept to Jersey</h3>\n<div class=\"path-for\">&#36;15 to start &middot; Credited at 5+ jerseys &middot; Mockup in 24&ndash;48h</div>\n<p class=\"path-description\">Have a concept, an AI render, a sketch, or just a strong brief? Send it over &mdash; a designer turns it into a production-ready uniform. Illustration, vectorization, and we refine it until it’s right.</p>\n<a href=\"#concept-transform\" class=\"path-cta\" id=\"studioPathCta\">Send My Concept</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── TRANSFORMATIONS ── -->\n<section class=\"transform-section\" id=\"concept-transform\">\n<div class=\"transform-header\">\n<p class=\"transform-eyebrow\">The Work</p>\n<h2 class=\"transform-title\">Your Concept. Production Ready.</h2>\n<p class=\"transform-sub\">Four real projects. The concept we received on the left. The production-ready uniform on the right.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transform-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"transform-item\">\n<div class=\"transform-side\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/1363fdd2412a9a6b668e7f50c3d5c6497b4cbd7042266ec5b63f6615efbb1a56.jpg\" alt=\"La Vidriera FC — AI concept render (input)\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span class=\"transform-side-label\">Input &mdash; AI Render</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transform-arrow-col\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"transform-side\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/11f5c073dc1c3d62cee9d5b4c39f166f8347637cfce733ea868d96030bfa6c5e.png\" alt=\"La Vidriera FC — MOMUTO production jersey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span class=\"transform-side-label label-after\">MOMUTO Design</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transform-meta\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"transform-input-type\">AI Render + Team Brief</p>\n<p class=\"transform-desc\"><strong>Snake-scale stripes vectorized, panther crest rebuilt.</strong> Gradient reworked for dye-sublimation, claw graphic redrawn, sponsor and number block set. Validated with you, then we produce it.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"transform-item\">\n<div class=\"transform-side\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/80438223b0b91b596f01d1b874c2f19d7440c1802812125f2209717a4f1c1e07.jpeg\" alt=\"Seefelds — hand-drawn flame jersey sketch (input)\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span class=\"transform-side-label\">Input &mdash; Hand Sketch</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transform-arrow-col\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"transform-side\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/d358bfaa66a1a6ef5afab054b3a627b7874de81a4ee5953cb1a8979554bc2285.png\" alt=\"Seefelds — MOMUTO production jersey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span class=\"transform-side-label label-after\">MOMUTO Design</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transform-meta\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"transform-input-type\">Hand Sketch + Brief</p>\n<p class=\"transform-desc\"><strong>Hand-drawn flames illustrated into clean vector graphics.</strong> Pinstripes set true, proportions refined for fabric, crest and number block built. Validated with you, then we produce it.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"transform-item\">\n<div class=\"transform-side\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/25ff712975b6c266aa5c9265b6532c6122c4c633cbd75225942a2e6d884eb842.png\" alt=\"Pecados Capitales — concept board (input)\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span class=\"transform-side-label\">Input &mdash; Concept Board</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transform-arrow-col\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"transform-side\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/ec78916fd71c968d956652b1e2453e39eaeb55f8f4eb8779e89a92c992ba911f.png\" alt=\"Pecados Capitales — MOMUTO production jersey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span class=\"transform-side-label label-after\">MOMUTO Design</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transform-meta\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"transform-input-type\">Concept Board + Brief</p>\n<p class=\"transform-desc\"><strong>Split angel motif interpreted, crest rebuilt.</strong> Black / red / gold palette matched, gold typography set, sponsor layout confirmed. Validated with you, then we produce it.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"transform-item\">\n<div class=\"transform-side\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/0b5177b519804889ae2e329b9c8e8239ad19316d485d90a8c2f66c3bf01cf40f.jpg\" alt=\"Kings — AI concept render (input)\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span class=\"transform-side-label\">Input &mdash; AI Render</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transform-arrow-col\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"></i></div>\n<div class=\"transform-side\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/2f0ddfc2e032643727db21f9cf433df70176294aaab3edbb04746cc722ae0cc5.png\" alt=\"Kings — MOMUTO production jersey\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<span class=\"transform-side-label label-after\">MOMUTO Design</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"transform-meta\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"transform-input-type\">AI Render + Sponsors</p>\n<p class=\"transform-desc\"><strong>Dragon graphic vectorized, black-on-black tonal balance dialed in.</strong> Crest cleaned, sponsor blocks placed, name and number set. Validated with you, then we produce it.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── PAYMENT GATE ── -->\n<section class=\"gate-section\" id=\"payment-gate\">\n<div class=\"gate-container\">\n<p class=\"gate-eyebrow\">Custom Design &mdash; Concept to Production-Ready Jersey</p>\n<div class=\"gate-box\">\n  <h2>Send Us Your Concept</h2>\n  <p class=\"gate-price\"><strong>&#36;15 to start</strong> &mdash; credited in full to orders of 5 or more jerseys, free for a team order</p>\n  <ul class=\"gate-features\">\n    <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i><span><strong>A designer on your concept</strong> within 24h</span></li>\n    <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i><span><strong>First mockup delivered</strong> in 24&ndash;48h</span></li>\n    <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i><span><strong>We refine it with you</strong> until it&rsquo;s right</span></li>\n    <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i><span><strong>Illustration &amp; vectorization</strong> included &mdash; AI concepts, sketches, custom graphics</span></li>\n    <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i><span><strong>Production-ready files</strong> for dye-sublimation printing</span></li>\n    <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i><span><strong>&#36;15 credited to your order</strong> at 5+ jerseys</span></li>\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"gate-email-row\">\n    <input type=\"email\" class=\"gate-email-input\" id=\"gateEmail\" placeholder=\"Your email address\" />\n    <a href=\"https://buy.stripe.com/8x2fZhe204q8ge32KV3wQ0M\" class=\"gate-pay-btn\" id=\"gatePayBtn\">Send My Concept &middot; &#36;15 &rarr;</a>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"gate-refund-guarantee\">The <strong>&#36;15</strong> covers a designer&rsquo;s time on this concept and is credited in full to orders of 5 or more jerseys &mdash; free for a team order.</p>\n  <p class=\"gate-refund-note\">Secure payment via Stripe &bull; Credited to your order at 5+ jerseys</p>\n  <p class=\"gate-refund-note\">By starting a design you agree the reference you send and the finished jersey may appear as a before/after in our gallery &mdash; tell us anytime if you&rsquo;d rather stay private.</p>\n  <hr class=\"gate-divider\" />\n  <p class=\"gate-alt\">Prefer to design it yourself? &nbsp;<a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&configId=ypi9qc1z&suitName=mamuto3suit1&lang=en&langguage=en\">3D Designer</a> and <a href=\"/pages/ready-to-play\">Ready to Play</a> are free, instant, and yours.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── BRIEF FORM (hidden until paid) ── -->\n<section class=\"form-section\" id=\"brief-form-section\" style=\"display:none;\">\n<div class=\"form-container\">\n<div class=\"form-content\" id=\"cta-form\">\n<div class=\"form-intro\">\n<h2>Tell Us About Your Jersey</h2>\n<p>You&rsquo;re in. Upload your concept &mdash; an AI render, a sketch, or just your colors and references &mdash; and the more you share, the better the first mockup.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress-indicator\">\n<div class=\"progress-step active\"><span class=\"step-label\">1</span> <span class=\"step-text\">Details</span></div>\n<div class=\"progress-step\" id=\"progress2\"><span class=\"step-label\">2</span> <span class=\"step-text\">Style</span></div>\n<div class=\"progress-step\" id=\"progress3\"><span class=\"step-label\">3</span> <span class=\"step-text\">Submit</span></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"formContentWrapper\">\n<form id=\"proposalForm\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\" action=\"https://momuto-api.vercel.app/api/submit\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_next\" value=\"https://us.momuto.com/pages/customized-design-confirmed\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_flow\" value=\"custom-deposit\" />\n\n<div class=\"form-step active\" id=\"step1\">\n<div class=\"form-section-inner\">\n<div class=\"input-group\"><input type=\"text\" id=\"customerName\" name=\"firstname\" placeholder=\"Your Name / Manager\" required /></div>\n<div class=\"input-group\"><input type=\"email\" id=\"customerEmail\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Contact Email\" required /></div>\n<div class=\"input-group\"><input type=\"text\" id=\"teamName\" name=\"company\" placeholder=\"Team Name\" required /></div>\n<div class=\"input-group\"><input type=\"text\" id=\"leagueName\" name=\"industry\" placeholder=\"League or Tournament\" required /></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-navigation\" style=\"justify-content: flex-end;\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"next-step\">NEXT STEP</button></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"form-step\" id=\"step2\">\n<div class=\"form-section-inner\">\n<h4>1. Team Badge</h4>\n<div class=\"custom-file-upload\"><label for=\"clubCrest\"><i class=\"fas fa-upload\"></i> Upload Badge</label> <input type=\"file\" id=\"clubCrest\" name=\"upload_file\" accept=\"image/*\" onchange=\"previewLogo(this)\" /><div id=\"fileNameDisplay\"></div><div id=\"logoPreview\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; max-width: 100px;\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-section-inner\">\n<h4>1b. Design Concept</h4>\n<p style=\"font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-dim); margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 300;\">AI render, sketch, reference jersey, or any visual concept. Skip if you&rsquo;d rather brief us in words.</p>\n<div class=\"custom-file-upload\"><label for=\"designConcept\"><i class=\"fas fa-upload\"></i> Upload Concept</label> <input type=\"file\" id=\"designConcept\" name=\"design_concept\" accept=\"image/*,.pdf\" onchange=\"previewDesign(this)\" /><div id=\"designNameDisplay\"></div><div id=\"designPreview\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; max-width: 200px;\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-section-inner\">\n<h4>2. Main Colors</h4>\n<div class=\"colors-row\">\n<div class=\"color-col\"><label>Primary</label><div class=\"color-circle\" id=\"primaryColorCircle\" style=\"background-color: #e2214b;\" onclick=\"openColorModal('primary')\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"color-col\"><label>Secondary</label><div class=\"color-circle\" id=\"secondaryColorCircle\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" onclick=\"openColorModal('secondary')\"></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-section-inner\">\n<h4>3. Visual Style</h4>\n<p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom: 15px;\">From 1 (Classic) to 10 (Modern/Bold)</p>\n<div class=\"style-scale\"><span>1</span> <input type=\"range\" id=\"stylePreference\" name=\"stylePreference\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" value=\"5\" /> <span>10</span></div>\n<div class=\"style-extremes\">\n<div class=\"extreme\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/49703/cart/resources/20260129/b73f2059037c0ac1782023bdfdc67c9c.png\" alt=\"Classic Style\" /><p>Classic</p></div>\n<div class=\"extreme\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/pics/f3184bab61ef27ee9d496b45c4632c611e7ae04ef574c76cfc29ee3404a7b9c3.png\" alt=\"Bold Style\" /><p>Bold</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-section-inner\">\n<h4>4. Estimated Quantity</h4>\n<div class=\"size-slider\"><div class=\"size-track\"></div>\n<div class=\"size-options\">\n<div class=\"size-option\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"size-1-4\" name=\"orderSize\" value=\"1-4\" class=\"size-radio\" checked /> <label for=\"size-1-4\" class=\"size-label\"><span class=\"size-button\"></span> 1-4</label></div>\n<div class=\"size-option\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"size-5-10\" name=\"orderSize\" value=\"5-10\" class=\"size-radio\" /> <label for=\"size-5-10\" class=\"size-label\"><span class=\"size-button\"></span> 5-10</label></div>\n<div class=\"size-option\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"size-11-20\" name=\"orderSize\" value=\"11-20\" class=\"size-radio\" /> <label for=\"size-11-20\" class=\"size-label\"><span class=\"size-button\"></span> 11-20</label></div>\n<div class=\"size-option\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"size-21-50\" name=\"orderSize\" value=\"21-50\" class=\"size-radio\" /> <label for=\"size-21-50\" class=\"size-label\"><span class=\"size-button\"></span> 21-50</label></div>\n<div class=\"size-option\"><input type=\"radio\" id=\"size-51-plus\" name=\"orderSize\" value=\"51+\" class=\"size-radio\" /> <label for=\"size-51-plus\" class=\"size-label\"><span class=\"size-button\"></span> 51+</label></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-navigation\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"prev-step\">BACK</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"next-step\">CONTINUE</button></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"form-step\" id=\"step3\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\"><h3>All Set!</h3><p style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\">Review your details and submit. Your designer will be in touch within 24h.</p></div>\n<div class=\"terms-checkbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"termsAccept\" name=\"termsAccept\" required /> <label for=\"termsAccept\"> I accept the <a href=\"/pages/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">privacy policy</a>.</label></div>\n<div class=\"form-navigation\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"prev-step\">BACK</button> <button type=\"submit\" class=\"submit-form\">SUBMIT BRIEF</button></div>\n</div>\n\n<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"primaryColorValue\" name=\"primaryColorValue\" value=\"#e2214b\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"secondaryColorValue\" name=\"secondaryColorValue\" value=\"#ffffff\" />\n</form>\n</div>\n<div id=\"confirmationMessage\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"success-icon\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle\"></i></div>\n<h3>Brief Received!</h3>\n<p>Your designer will be in touch within 24h.</p>\n<div class=\"social-follow\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\"><p style=\"color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.85rem;\">In the meantime, check out our work:</p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/momuto_es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:var(--accent-red);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">@momuto_es</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── FAQ ── -->\n<section class=\"faq-section\">\n<div class=\"faq-container\">\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<div class=\"faq-list\">\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Why is there a $15 fee to start?</h3><p>A designer gives your concept real hours &mdash; research, illustration, vectorization, and revisions until it’s right. The $15 keeps the studio focused on teams building something real, and it&rsquo;s credited in full to your order at 5 or more jerseys &mdash; free for a team order.</p></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>When is the $15 credited back?</h3><p>When your order reaches 5 or more jerseys, it&rsquo;s credited to your order total at checkout.</p></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>What if my order doesn&rsquo;t reach 5 jerseys?</h3><p>The $15 covers a designer&rsquo;s time on your first concept and mockup. If your order stays under 5 jerseys, that fee is simply what pays for the design work you already received &mdash; no additional charge, and nothing else to settle.</p></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>What&rsquo;s included?</h3><p>A designer on your concept, first mockup in 24&ndash;48h, revisions until it’s right, illustration and vectorization work (AI concepts, sketches, reference jerseys, custom graphics), and production-ready files for dye-sublimation printing.</p></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Can I submit an AI-generated concept (ChatGPT, Midjourney)?</h3><p>Yes &mdash; that&rsquo;s exactly what this is built for. Upload your AI render and our designer will adapt it into a production-ready uniform while preserving your vision. This includes vectorizing custom shapes, replicating gradients and textures, and adjusting for real fabric constraints.</p></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>What if I just have a brief and no concept?</h3><p>That&rsquo;s fine. Describe your colors, style direction, and any references (existing jerseys, palettes, mood). The more detail the better, but our designers work from briefs every day. You&rsquo;ll get a mockup in 24&ndash;48h regardless.</p></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Prefer to design it yourself? What are the free options?</h3><p>Two free routes: the <a href=\"https://design.momuto.com/3d-configurator/configurator.html?userId=userIdUrl&configId=ypi9qc1z&suitName=mamuto3suit1&lang=en&langguage=en\">3D designer</a> lets you design in real time with 30+ templates and instant preview. The <a href=\"/pages/ready-to-play\">Ready to Play collection</a> has professional pre-designed jerseys at 10% off custom pricing, with a personalized 24h preview.</p></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Is there a minimum order?</h3><p>No. You can order from a single jersey upward. Pricing starts at &#36;45.90 for one jersey, down to &#36;25.90 per jersey at 10+ units. The $15 is credited to your order at 5+ jerseys.</p></div>\n<div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>How long until I receive the uniforms?</h3><p>25&ndash;30 days from order confirmation: 7&ndash;12 days production + 10&ndash;15 days shipping.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ── COLOR MODAL ── -->\n<div id=\"colorModal\" class=\"color-modal\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div id=\"colorModalOverlay\" class=\"modal-overlay\" onclick=\"closeColorModal()\"></div>\n<div class=\"color-modal-content\">\n<div class=\"color-modal-header\"><h3>Select Color</h3><button class=\"close-modal\" onclick=\"closeColorModal()\">&times;</button></div>\n<div class=\"color-modal-body\"><div id=\"colorSwatches\"></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n  var isPaid = params.get('paid') === 'true';\n\n  if (isPaid) {\n    // Show confirmation banner\n    document.getElementById('paidBanner').style.display = 'block';\n    // Hide payment gate, show form\n    document.getElementById('payment-gate').style.display = 'none';\n    document.getElementById('brief-form-section').style.display = 'block';\n    // Scroll to form smoothly after a short delay\n    setTimeout(function() {\n      document.getElementById('cta-form').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\n    }, 300);\n  }\n\n  // Gate: require a valid email, capture it as a lead (best-effort), then go to Stripe\n  var gateEmail = document.getElementById('gateEmail');\n  var gatePayBtn = document.getElementById('gatePayBtn');\n  var baseStripeUrl = 'https://buy.stripe.com/8x2fZhe204q8ge32KV3wQ0M';\n\n  if (gateEmail && gatePayBtn) {\n    var validEmail = function (v) { return /^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$/.test((v || '').trim()); };\n    var setReady = function (on) {\n      gatePayBtn.classList.toggle('is-disabled', !on);\n      gatePayBtn.setAttribute('aria-disabled', on ? 'false' : 'true');\n      gatePayBtn.href = on\n        ? baseStripeUrl + '?prefilled_email=' + encodeURIComponent(gateEmail.value.trim())\n        : baseStripeUrl;\n    };\n    setReady(false);\n    gateEmail.addEventListener('input', function () { setReady(validEmail(this.value)); });\n\n    gatePayBtn.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n      var email = gateEmail.value.trim();\n      e.preventDefault();\n      if (!validEmail(email)) { gateEmail.focus(); return; }\n      var navigated = false;\n      var go = function () {\n        if (navigated) return; navigated = true;\n        window.location.href = baseStripeUrl + '?prefilled_email=' + encodeURIComponent(email);\n      };\n      var locale = (location.hostname.match(/^(es|fr|it)\\./) || [])[1] || 'en';\n      try {\n        fetch('https://momuto-api.vercel.app/api/lead', {\n          method: 'POST', keepalive: true,\n          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n          body: JSON.stringify({ email: email, locale: locale, source: window.location.href })\n        }).then(go, go);\n      } catch (_) { go(); }\n      setTimeout(go, 1200); // safety: never trap the user\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Smooth scroll for Studio path card CTA\n  var studioCta = document.getElementById('studioPathCta');\n  if (studioCta) {\n    studioCta.addEventListener('click', function(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      (document.getElementById('concept-transform') || document.getElementById('payment-gate')).scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\n    });\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n<!-- inject:design-request.js -->",
  "detail_url": "https://us.momuto.com/pages/detail/6492204"
}
